Overlay patch 0004 rev2 (rebased for upstream 49c5312a): Ghostship iOS
app target glue. Upstream now ships its OWN iOS target (86d8edeb..49c5312a:
PLATFORM overridable, global __IOS__ define, IOS_SIGNING option,
storyboard/icon/plist bundle, o2r copy-if-exists) — this patch keeps only
our deltas: skip upstream's mid-configure game-level toolchain include
(toolchain/sysroot come from the caller + LUS's ios-toolchain-populate,
overlay 0009); drop the placeholder YOUR_TEAM_ID attribute (signing comes
from GS_IOS_* cache vars in the app-target block); define
GS_IOS_UIKIT_SHELL=1 (overlay 0041 keys off it to default upstream's ImGui
touch overlay OFF — this build ships the UIKit shell); main=SDL_main on
src/port/Game.cpp (SDL2main's UIKit shim owns the real main); app shell
wired via -DGS_IOS_SHELL_DIR; bundle id/team as cache vars (sim default
com.harbourmasters.ghostship, unsigned; device id is reserved elsewhere);
resources bundled: host-built ghostship.o2r (-DGS_O2R_PATH),
gamecontrollerdb.txt, and the Torch extraction manifests (config.yml +
assets/ -- the in-app extractor resolves them via GetAppBundlePath,
overlay 0005). Missing Info.plist keys added (fullscreen, status bar,
CADisableMinimumFrameDurationOnPhone, indirect input, ghostship:// URL
scheme). rev1's ENABLE_OPENGL and ENABLE_SCRIPTING edits are RETIRED —
upstream now gates both itself (ENABLE_OPENGL !iOS at CMakeLists:213,
scripting forced OFF for iOS/Android at :463; ex-overlay-0006 is fully
absorbed: Engine.cpp call sites are #ifdef ENABLE_SCRIPTING, ScriptLoader.h
self-guards, SatellaClient.cpp self-gates on USE_NETWORKING which now
defaults OFF on iOS).

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
